  m_text: "PACK THE GIFTS\nDrag gifts into the box. Select a gift and use Rotate
    to turn it. \n\nADD CUSHIONING\nDrag the scoop into the peanut bin to fill it.
    Release the full scoop over an empty parcel space to cushion all remaining gaps.\n\nCHECK
    CUSTOMERS BUDGET\nBox, peanuts, and postage must fit within the customer\u2019s
    budget.\n\nPLACEMENT GUIDES\nUse Toggle Grid to show or hide the packing grid."
